    <h1>Custom-coded websites for service businesses. <em>Built to bring in calls.</em></h1>
    <p>Pikes Peak Web Designs builds, hosts, and maintains custom-coded websites for small service businesses across the United States and Canada. There is no WordPress under the hood, no template anyone else has used, and no offshore relay chain in the middle of the engagement. The person you hire is the person who builds your site, ships it, and keeps it running afterwards.</p>
